<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reduces Amgen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reduces Amgen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it had reduced Amgen Inc to intermediate and long-term neutral from its previous rating of intermediate and long-term accululate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Amgen was off 4-1/4 to 52-7/8.</p>
